   "message": "feat(core): animate Stuffed Bear with layer 4 addition, layer 5 colour and layer 7b base P/T\n\nStuffed Bear (MID 259) is the pool's first permanent that is not a creature until an\nability animates it: \"{2}: This artifact becomes a 4/4 green Bear artifact creature\nuntil end of turn.\" One printed ability creates three until-end-of-turn continuous\neffects (layer 4 creature-type addition, layer 5 colour set, layer 7b base 4/4), so\ncleanup ends them and departure prunes them through the existing pipeline.\n\nThe rules layer now asks Game::is_creature and Game::has_color instead of reading the\nprinted card type and cost, so an animated artifact is a full creature (targets,\ncombat, removal, dies-watchers) and a permanent that can animate itself records\nCR 302.6 summoning sickness on arrival. Nine focused tests, four mutation REDs with\nbyte-for-byte restore, and a four-seat 40-life package journey with a separate\nreplay.",
